@startuml
' Figure 9.3  Journal and replay
' Reading order: top to bottom; the run writes intent and result per
' step; replay reads results and calls nothing.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Engine" as E <<ops>>
participant "Model" as M <<model>>
database "Journal" as J <<evidence>>
participant "Airline" as W <<ops>>
== Run ==
E -> J : begin step 4
E -> M : choose
M --> E : LK 2210
E -> J : done step 4
E -> W : rebook LK 2210
W --> E : ticket
E -> J : done step 9
== Replay ==
J --> E : recorded outputs
note right of E : no calls
@enduml
